data: {"event":"message","conversation_id":"8a75e116-a13c-4cec-b631-7c4a4ddc83ba","message_id":"5b208348-04d2-46c3-b934-156b085b13ee","created_at":1793605894,"task_id":"511d66dd-b4de-45e8-819e-110ad2c46d3c","id":"5b208348-04d2-46c3-b934-156b085b13ee","answer":"· 玩家【通缉演示三】对老周做了：把一只假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下。老周的反应：老周怒瞪你一眼，把假蟑螂踢到你脚边，嘴里骂道：。怒气+3。\n· 玩家把招牌菜喂给黄狗，老周怒气冲冲，怒气 +4\n· 玩家偷偷把老周的招牌酒换成兑水的假酒，老周怒气冲天，要求玩家重新酿制（怒气 +5）\n· 老周被辣得直咳嗽，记下了这次恶作剧（怒气 +3）\n· 玩家锯短了老周常坐的藤椅一条腿，老周把小桌掀翻，怒气 +5。","from_variable_selector":["parse_recall","ledger"]}

data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"8a75e116-a13c-4cec-b631-7c4a4ddc83ba","message_id":"5b208348-04d2-46c3-b934-156b085b13ee","created_at":1793605894,"task_id":"511d66dd-b4de-45e8-819e-110ad2c46d3c","workflow_run_id":"2b9b1e10-380e-4e53-804f-0b2c4c514e50","data":{"id":"40608e04-228e-429b-bead-72fe7fb00f2d","node_id":"parse_llm","node_type":"code","title":"解析老周的反应","index":9,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"raw":"老周冷冷一笑，拿起那壶咸酒：“尝尝这甜中带咸的风味。”怒气+3。{\"reply\":\"老周冷冷一笑，拿起那壶咸酒：‘尝尝这甜中带咸的风味。’\",\"verdict\":\"记仇\",\"grudge_delta\":3,\"memory\":\"玩家把糖罐和盐罐对调，让整晚的甜酒都变咸，老周怒气+3。\"}","player":"通缉演示三","action":"把糖罐和盐罐对调，让整晚的甜酒都变咸","grudge_total":20,"knowledge":[{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"6f581b0b-5fb5-4955-80e5-ddd030eded75","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.587196763296476,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":43,"segment_word_count":160,"segment_position":4,"segment_index_node_hash":"393d8e83e8adadae926b7cb0aed541c67b5b8719971ddf9d1953b153d2db3c03","doc_metadata":null,"position":1},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"盐当糖\n- 招式名：盐罐换糖罐\n- 操作方式：把老周做甜酒用的糖罐和盐罐对调。\n- 预期效果：整晚的甜酒都变成咸的，老周自己尝了一口后表情扭曲。\n- 老周的反应：沉默三秒，然后把那壶咸酒原价卖给你，说“不能浪费”。\n- 反制手段：从此糖罐上贴着你的名字，专供你一个人。\n- 危险度：★★☆（破坏一整晚的生意，账记得很牢）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"2af7d7a2-c19a-4a7d-bc04-731fe36933dc","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5052560593506173,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":25,"segment_word_count":182,"segment_position":2,"segment_index_node_hash":"53cb5e6288e6f0307670899ccf14539241892a0c2e6727d9424bbaad37059d2d","doc_metadata":null,"position":2},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"辣椒水啤酒\n- 招式名：辣椒水换啤酒\n- 操作方式：趁老周转身擦杯子，把一小瓶辣椒水倒进他的扎啤里。\n- 预期效果：老周喝一大口后被辣得咳嗽、眼泪直流，客人哄笑。\n- 老周的反应：先愣住，再猛灌凉水，然后盯着你冷笑，把这事记在心里。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒先自己抿一口；若你已经记仇，可能反手给你一杯更辣的。\n- 危险度：★★☆（伤胃不伤命，但很容易被记住）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"51a70d86-95bc-42d1-b7ae-ab4653c6ae73","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.49696424083891544,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":18,"segment_word_count":161,"segment_position":7,"segment_index_node_hash":"d6c65ece495142d804d1b649ab8b02d535dd4ed5802f7820cb1dcaf6da5bad9b","doc_metadata":null,"position":3},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"换掉招牌酒\n- 招式名：招牌酒掉包\n- 操作方式：把吧台后那瓶招牌陈酿换成颜色相近的廉价酒。\n- 预期效果：老周给熟客倒酒时被当场拆穿，面子上挂不住。\n- 老周的反应：先给客人赔笑换酒，转头把空瓶子摆在你面前当证据。\n- 反制手段：你的酒从此由他亲手从地窖取，当着你的面开瓶。\n- 危险度：★★★（砸招牌，老周最恨这一招）","summary":null}]},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"delta":3,"new_total":23,"reply":"老周冷冷一笑，拿起那壶咸酒：‘尝尝这甜中带咸的风味。","verdict":"记仇","threat":"通缉令","memory_text":"玩家把糖罐和盐罐对调，让整晚的甜酒都变咸，老周怒气 +3。","kb_titles":"prank_compendium.md"},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.055657,"execution_metadata":null,"created_at":1793605895,"finished_at":1793605895,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

