data: {"event":"message_end","conversation_id":"8a75e116-a13c-4cec-b631-7c4a4ddc83ba","message_id":"5b208348-04d2-46c3-b934-156b085b13ee","created_at":1793605894,"task_id":"511d66dd-b4de-45e8-819e-110ad2c46d3c","id":"5b208348-04d2-46c3-b934-156b085b13ee","metadata":{"annotation_reply":null,"retriever_resources":[{"knowledge_fs_citation":null,"position":1,"dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_asset_id":null,"document_name":"prank_compendium.md","document_revision":null,"document_version":null,"data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"6f581b0b-5fb5-4955-80e5-ddd030eded75","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.587196763296476,"hit_count":43,"word_count":160,"segment_position":4,"index_node_hash":"393d8e83e8adadae926b7cb0aed541c67b5b8719971ddf9d1953b153d2db3c03","content":"盐当糖\n- 招式名：盐罐换糖罐\n- 操作方式：把老周做甜酒用的糖罐和盐罐对调。\n- 预期效果：整晚的甜酒都变成咸的，老周自己尝了一口后表情扭曲。\n- 老周的反应：沉默三秒，然后把那壶咸酒原价卖给你，说“不能浪费”。\n- 反制手段：从此糖罐上贴着你的名字，专供你一个人。\n- 危险度：★★☆（破坏一整晚的生意，账记得很牢）","page":null,"doc_metadata":null,"title":null,"files":null,"summary":null},{"knowledge_fs_citation":null,"position":2,"dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_asset_id":null,"document_name":"prank_compendium.md","document_revision":null,"document_version":null,"data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"2af7d7a2-c19a-4a7d-bc04-731fe36933dc","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5052560593506173,"hit_count":25,"word_count":182,"segment_position":2,"index_node_hash":"53cb5e6288e6f0307670899ccf14539241892a0c2e6727d9424bbaad37059d2d","content":"辣椒水啤酒\n- 招式名：辣椒水换啤酒\n- 操作方式：趁老周转身擦杯子，把一小瓶辣椒水倒进他的扎啤里。\n- 预期效果：老周喝一大口后被辣得咳嗽、眼泪直流，客人哄笑。\n- 老周的反应：先愣住，再猛灌凉水，然后盯着你冷笑，把这事记在心里。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒先自己抿一口；若你已经记仇，可能反手给你一杯更辣的。\n- 危险度：★★☆（伤胃不伤命，但很容易被记住）","page":null,"doc_metadata":null,"title":null,"files":null,"summary":null},{"knowledge_fs_citation":nu